# ST1c: ST0-TQ1's last view, still: the flame close, flickering, in the Classic box
# (960x600 shown 4:3), Brightness 0.7 ("The user asked for that: a warm feeling"). The
# inset diagram over it is the edit's.

map e1m3

duration 8.7
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7
cvar r_torchflicker 1

camera fixed -1352,-520,0 at -1352,-432,14

sound on
events on
